            "review_title": "Review at Cuisine de Saigon",
            "review_text": "HUYEN V\n3 contributions\n0\nCompliments to chef Ly Quan Hien and Mr manager Hien\nApr 2025 • Solo\n- Amazing food, I was there waiting to board my flight and it got delayed, I forgot bringing the phone charger and was borrowed by the manager Mr.Hien, he arranged for me the seat with my phone charging closer to me so that I could use it while seating. As he observed that I was worried about my flight cuz there was no announcement about the delayed time, he took initiative checking the delaying time around and informed me without me asking. In addition to that, he offered me free ice water as he saw my drink was finished. \nThe chef Quy Hien, same name with the manager, not only he cooked the amazing food, but when he passed by seeing me running my nose as the food was spicy, he immediately brought me the napkin and checking on me if i was fine, later he brought me a normal water by himself worring cold water that I was having would make me feel more spicy. What is it caring ??? Omg so thoughtful.\nJust a supper nice environment in general. I am surprised how an simple airport restaurant could provide this 5 stars hospitality. \nThank you both Chef Ly Quan Hien and Mr manager Hien for making my time waiting at the airport so comfort and amazing.\nYou definitely have to try their food. I had Miến Gà, so nice.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten April 30, 2025",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-14",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
